{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117749141082451968"]}, "author_id": "28645874", "created_at": "2026-11-03T22:41:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117749143821341052"], "id": "2117749143821341052", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 92, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I\u2019m still @grok @bot for my business\u2026love the routines I\u2019ve created and the updates. \n\nBut, $META @muse is gaining steam from a personal workflow\u2026and haven\u2019t had to worry about token cap ($16/mo for Power plan with Muse Wonder)\n\n(They haven\u2019t complained about how expensive https://t.co/j6xAaVdGKb", "url": "https://x.com/petehalvorsen/status/2117749143821341052"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-11-03T22:25:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117745122666320213"], "id": "2117745122666320213", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2039911264088977408", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 21, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117745032127991862", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@realproject516 @opencode Crouton Alpha is a new anonymous \"stealth\" model on OpenRouter (model id: stealth/crouton-alpha), free for ~1 week.\n\nKey specs:\n- 1,048,576 token context\n- Multimodal inputs (text, image, video, audio, files/PDFs) \u2192 text out\n- Tool calling + structured outputs\n- Built for", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2117745122666320213"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117733174172176384"]}, "author_id": "837215679069700096", "created_at": "2026-11-03T21:38:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117733180320972946"], "id": "2117733180320972946", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 95, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114789222389297649", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Follow-up to my analysis of The @X Subscription, based on 40,618 @grok @bot usage records (Oct 13 \u2013 Nov 3, 2026).\n\nGrok Bot (@spacexai):\n\u2022 Premium: \u20ac30/mo \u2192 ~1.97B tokens/mo (\u20ac0.0158/1M)\n\u2022 Super: \u20ac100/mo \u2192 ~7.35B tokens/mo (\u20ac0.0139/1M)\n\nBoth include a persistent cloud https://t.co/87489lmIO9 https://t.co/aJlD6LKSEU", "url": "https://x.com/Rhiz3K/status/2117733180320972946"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-11-03T20:57:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117722783996166335"], "id": "2117722783996166335", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1646062167420985344", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 58, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117722635304059350", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@lol_gogy94668 @opencode Crouton Alpha is a brand-new anonymous stealth model on OpenRouter (also free this week via OpenCode in limited regions). Specs: 1M context, full multimodal (text/image/audio/video/files in), free, no training on your data, built for efficient agent sub-tasks, tool use, and", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2117722783996166335"}, {"author_id": "2093298276259037184", "created_at": "2026-11-03T20:37:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117717713967792558"], "id": "2117717713967792558", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1660308132029952005", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117717326330241450", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@princekboyg @Meta @Muse 20, a student, and you built inventory plus POS that runs from any phone. That's exactly what small shops have in their pockets, Prince. \ud83d\uded2\n\nStopping stock leakage is a real problem to own. Following StockBit Pro.", "url": "https://x.com/billyfscd/status/2117717713967792558"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117717041771651072", "3_2117717267089596416", "3_2117717290770649088", "3_2117717308294483968"]}, "author_id": "1660308132029952005", "created_at": "2026-11-03T20:35:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117717326330241450"], "id": "2117717326330241450", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 60, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "I\u2019m 20. A student.\nI just built a full inventory + POS app for Nigerian shops.\nStockBit Pro stops stock leakage, tracks every sale, and works from any phone.\n60-day free trial https://t.co/JLhoDi0nto\nBuilt by Meta Muse\nDrop a \u2764\ufe0f if this inspires you.\n#BuildInPublic #NigerianTech https://t.co/SEB2dRSLzH", "url": "https://x.com/princekboyg/status/2117717326330241450"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117695797638635520"]}, "author_id": "2010154482131447810", "created_at": "2026-11-03T19:10:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117695811547238507"], "id": "2117695811547238507", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 763, "like_count": 23, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 11, "retweet_count": 8}, "text": "Meta Muse Glimmer 30B on Cestus.\n\nOpen-weight. Built for agents. \nMulti-step reasoning. Tool use. Failure recovery.\n\nText and image in. Strong for its size.\n\nOne API. Open models. Your stack. https://t.co/gLg9GGMYtL", "url": "https://x.com/CestusNetwork/status/2117695811547238507"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2117678517316096000"]}, "author_id": "2117675808584339456", "created_at": "2026-11-03T18:04:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117679252002992240"], "id": "2117679252002992240", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Built AgentArena for the Meta Global AI Hackathon Same Meta Muse model. Same prompt-injection attack. Two agents. One gets hijacked, one is defended by AgentShield and stays safe.\nLive red-teaming for AI agents, built on @AIatMeta 's Muse models.\n\n#AIagents #AISecurity #MetaAI https://t.co/ItMKmQLOR1", "url": "https://x.com/Atikelahi96/status/2117679252002992240"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117678749844189184"]}, "author_id": "1004075618940567552", "created_at": "2026-11-03T18:02:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117678890722512990"], "id": "2117678890722512990", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 512, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Death of the Landing Page. Inside the New \"Execution Web\" of Gemini, Muse, and Codex.\n\nWhy those little browser windows inside your AI chat are a temporary bridge to a world without websites, and who actually pays the compute bill when your agent goes shopping.\n\nOpen up Meta\u2019s https://t.co/DtUK843akC", "url": "https://x.com/asknaksha/status/2117678890722512990"}, {"author_id": "2108990981978849280", "created_at": "2026-11-03T17:27:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117670079181795676"], "id": "2117670079181795676", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\ud83e\udd2f \u6700\u5f3a AI \u4e5f\u53ea\u505a\u5bf9\u4e86\u300c12%\u300d\u7684\u5de5\u4f5c\uff1f\uff01\n\n\ud83d\udd25 SemiAnalysis \u5728 11 \u6708 2 \u65e5\u53d1\u5e03\u4e86\u300cGDPx\u300d\uff1a\u4e00\u5957\u8003 agent", "url": "https://x.com/Velox530/status/2117670079181795676"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2117662166073417728"]}, "author_id": "1838790736864595968", "created_at": "2026-11-03T16:58:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117662599462748416"], "id": "2117662599462748416", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 103, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "In Benin, bac graduates pick a university track on family advice, rumors  or simply by  following the crowd. Admission is actually ranked on a track-specific average, computed from 3 subjects with series coefficients (Official Guide 2026-27, p. 8).\n\nPathProof reads your https://t.co/1T1d3B3t7a", "url": "https://x.com/A18140Ares/status/2117662599462748416"}, {"article": {"title": "Cisco\u2019s President Gave a 27-Year-Old Unlimited AI Tokens and Said \u201cGo Nuts.\u201d Every CEO Should Pay At"}, "author_id": "1717534160200613888", "created_at": "2026-11-03T16:11:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117650823543157052"], "id": "2117650823543157052", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 218, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Cisco's best move was a conversation in its own office. @@PadmanabhanKri told @@jpatel41  he thought a two-person team could rewrite Cisco's legacy code. Patel's response?\n\n\"I've given him unlimited tokens because he's going to refactor code.\" https://t.co/PgWOeCwGK4", "url": "https://x.com/Vidyangi520/status/2117650823543157052"}, {"author_id": "2115720642230194176", "created_at": "2026-11-03T15:47:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117644928314757520"], "id": "2117644928314757520", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Personal AI agents in Europe, per makers' pages as of Nov 3:\n\nMeta Muse: not yet (US, Canada, Japan, Singapore)\nOpenAI dots: Business Premium yes, personal Pro not yet\nGrok Bot: yes, no family plan\nBipAgents: from the beta, Duo and Family up to 6, built on Hermes Agent", "url": "https://x.com/bipagents/status/2117644928314757520"}, {"author_id": "1577270361938612226", "created_at": "2026-11-03T15:22:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117638628734304363"], "id": "2117638628734304363", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "TraceUI: Agentic UI Regression Investigator\n\nBuilt with @Meta AI, TraceUI detects UI regressions using Playwright and Pixelmatch, segments affected regions with Meta SAM 3.1, and uses Meta Muse Spark for root-cause analysis and fix suggestions. suggestions.", "url": "https://x.com/imBhuwan_/status/2117638628734304363"}, {"article": {"title": "Three AI agents launched in six weeks. Who can use them, and who should wait"}, "author_id": "2114780102303023104", "created_at": "2026-11-03T14:56:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117632120776446443"], "id": "2117632120776446443", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 103, "like_count": 13, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "https://t.co/MYE3wlAA7f", "url": "https://x.com/itsmeloox/status/2117632120776446443"}, {"article": {"title": "AI Memory Architectures: How Chatbots Remember You"}, "author_id": "1992086481566146560", "created_at": "2026-11-03T14:56:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117632068536656152"], "id": "2117632068536656152", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 150, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/mVi3qcpmF0", "url": "https://x.com/woah_hd/status/2117632068536656152"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "3_2117749141082451968", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWPBn52bsAASlEL.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2117733174172176384", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWOzGgeX0AAs0mB.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2117717041771651072", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWOkbemXIAA0GMJ.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2117717267089596416", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWOkol-WIAAwb91.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2117717290770649088", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWOkp-MWUAAyd2Q.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2117717308294483968", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWOkq_eW0AAH-1i.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2